    "title": {
      "en": "New Scarlet Monastery Hearthstone in WoW: Forever",
      "es": "Nueva piedra de hogar del Monasterio Escarlata en WoW: Forever"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "New Scarlet Monastery Hearthstone in WoW: Forever...",
      "es": "Nueva piedra de hogar del Monasterio Escarlata en WoW: Para siempre..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6afc0ef87b2a19.95341919\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">A new cosmetic Hearthstone has been found in WoW: Forever!<br><br>Cosmetic Hearthstones are new to WoW: Forever and give your character a unique animation during the 10-second cast time while casting. In WoW: Forever, the first cosmetic Hearthstone has been discovered, <a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=284164/scarlet-hearthstone\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Scarlet Hearthstone\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_mage_flameorb.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Scarlet Hearthstone</span></a>. This toy goes into your Toy Box, but instead of casting it directly from there, it gives you <a class=\"q1 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=284163/scarlet-hearthstone\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Scarlet Hearthstone\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_mage_flameorb.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Scarlet Hearthstone</span></a>, which still takes up a bag slot. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><span data-markup-tooltip-container=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\" class=\"wowhead-tooltip-inline exclude-units wowhead-tooltip-inline-icon\"><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip wowhead-tooltip-width-restriction wowhead-tooltip-width-319.625\" data-game=\"wow\" data-tree=\"classicplus\" data-env=\"classicplus\" data-type=\"item\" data-visible=\"yes\" style=\"width: 319.625px; visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"whtt-tooltip-icon\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"iconmedium\" data-env=\"classicplus\" data-tree=\"classicplus\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\"><ins style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_mage_flameorb.jpg&quot;);\" class=\"lazy-load-background\"></ins><del></del></div></div><table><tbody><tr><td><table style=\"white-space: nowrap; width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--nstart--><b class=\"q3\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=284164/scarlet-hearthstone\" data-disable-wowhead-tooltip=\"true\">Scarlet Hearthstone</a></b><!--nend--><!--ndstart--><!--ndend--><span class=\"q whtt-extra whtt-ilvl\"><br>Item Level <!--ilvl-->35</span><!--bo--><br>Binds when picked up<br>Unique<!--ue--><!--ue--><br><span class=\"toycolor\">Toy</span><!--ebstats--><!--egstats--><!--eistats--><!--nameDescStats--></td></tr></tbody></table><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--useText:0:1--><span id=\"useText1\" class=\"q2\">Use: <!--useEffect:0:1--><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/spell=1315213/create-scarlet-hearthstone\" class=\"q2\">Create a Scarlet Hearthstone.</a> (1 Hour Cooldown)<!--useEffect:1--></span><!--useText:1--><!--itemEffects:1--><br><!--pvpEquip--><!--pvpEquip--></td></tr></tbody></table></td><th style=\"background-position: right top;\"></th></tr><tr><th style=\"background-position: left bottom;\"></th><th style=\"background-position: right bottom;\"></th></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip-powered\"></div></div></span><span data-markup-tooltip-container=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\" class=\"wowhead-tooltip-inline exclude-units wowhead-tooltip-inline-icon\"><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip wowhead-tooltip-width-restriction wowhead-tooltip-width-320\" data-game=\"wow\" data-tree=\"classicplus\" data-env=\"classicplus\" data-type=\"item\" data-visible=\"yes\" style=\"width: 320px; visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"whtt-tooltip-icon\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"iconmedium\" data-env=\"classicplus\" data-tree=\"classicplus\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\"><ins style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_mage_flameorb.jpg&quot;);\" class=\"lazy-load-background\"></ins><del></del></div></div><table><tbody><tr><td><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--nstart--><b class=\"q1\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=284163/scarlet-hearthstone\" data-disable-wowhead-tooltip=\"true\">Scarlet Hearthstone</a></b><!--nend--><!--ndstart--><!--ndend--><span class=\"q whtt-extra whtt-ilvl\"><br>Item Level <!--ilvl-->1</span><!--bo--><br>Binds when picked up<br>Unique<!--ue--><!--ue--><!--ebstats--><!--egstats--><!--eistats--><!--nameDescStats--></td></tr></tbody></table><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--useText:0:1--><span id=\"useText1\" class=\"q2\">Use: <!--useEffect:0:1--><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/spell=1315212/hearthstone\" class=\"q2\">Burn in the scarlet flames to return to Hearthstone Location. Speak to an Innkeeper in a different place to change your home location.</a><!--useEffect:1--></span><!--useText:1--><!--itemEffects:1--><br><!--pvpEquip--><!--pvpEquip--></td></tr></tbody></table></td><th style=\"background-position: right top;\"></th></tr><tr><th style=\"background-position: left bottom;\"></th><th style=\"background-position: right bottom;\"></th></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip-powered\"></div></div></span></div><br><br>Here's what the Hearthstone animation looks like.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><video controls=\"\" poster=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1309126-scarlet-hearthstone.png?maxWidth=800\" preload=\"metadata\" style=\"width: 800px;\"><source src=\"https://nether.wowhead.com/video-stream/445176-scarlet-hearthstone?dataEnv=1&amp;locale=0\"></video></div><br><br>According to <a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/potential-world-first-scarlet-hearthstone-toy-found-in-wow-forever/2415410\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Undyingshaman on the WoW Forums</a>, this item drops from <a data-entity=\"npc\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/npc=10828/high-general-abbendis\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">High General Abbendis</span></a> in the Eastern Plaguelands. <br><br>This is the first cosmetic Hearthstone in WoW: Forever and probably won't be the last. What other Hearthstones could be out there?</div>\n            \n            <noscript>A new cosmetic Hearthstone has been found in WoW: Forever!<br /><br />Cosmetic Hearthstones are new to WoW: Forever and give your character a unique animation during the 10-second cast time while casting. In WoW: Forever, the first cosmetic Hearthstone has been discovered, <a href=\"/forever/item=284164/scarlet-hearthstone\">Scarlet Hearthstone</a>. This toy goes into your Toy Box, but instead of casting it directly from there, it gives you <a href=\"/forever/item=284163/scarlet-hearthstone\">Scarlet Hearthstone</a>, which still takes up a bag slot. <br /><br />Here's what the Hearthstone animation looks like.<br /><br />According to <a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/potential-world-first-scarlet-hearthstone-toy-found-in-wow-forever/2415410\" rel=\"nofollow\">Undyingshaman on the WoW Forums</a>, this item drops from <a href=\"/forever/npc=10828/high-general-abbendis\">High General Abbendis</a> in the Eastern Plaguelands. <br /><br />This is the first cosmetic Hearthstone in WoW: Forever and probably won't be the last. What other Hearthstones could be out there?</noscript>            \n        ",
