    "title": {
      "en": "Forever 101: Blizzard Releases New Player Overview Video for WoW: Forever",
      "es": "Forever 101: Blizzard publica un nuevo vídeo de presentación para jugadores de WoW: Forever"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Forever 101: Blizzard Releases New Player Overview Video for WoW: Forever...",
      "es": "Forever 101: Blizzard publica un nuevo vídeo de presentación para jugadores de WoW: Forever..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6afc0ff62873a3.58759844\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has released a Forever 101 video, which serves as an overview for new players of WoW: Forever. <br><br>This video serves as an intro to new players for WoW: Forever and covers:<ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Social features - The Recent Allies panel and Camping</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Profession</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Capital Cities</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Stocking up on supplies.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Portals and summons.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Guilds.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Max Level Content.</div></li></ul><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"wh-youtube exclude-units lazy-load-background\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: url(&quot;https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7P-i2zipbeM/sddefault.jpg&quot;); max-width: 800px;\"><a aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"wh-youtube-inner\" href=\"javascript:\" style=\"padding-top: 45%;\"><i class=\"fa fa-play-circle\"></i></a></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has released a Forever 101 video, which serves as an overview for new players of WoW: Forever. <br /><br />This video serves as an intro to new players for WoW: Forever and covers:<br /><ul><li>Social features - The Recent Allies panel and Camping</li><li>Profession</li><li>Capital Cities</li><li>Stocking up on supplies.</li><li>Portals and summons.</li><li>Guilds.</li><li>Max Level Content.</li></ul><br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
